==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*8 [[General GreGory|General GreGories]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 43.33~46.67 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Elephantidae Papaou]] spawns as the boss after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Crustaceous Scissorex]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[General GreGory|General GreGories]] spawn after 153.33 seconds<sup>4,600f</sup>, delay 43.33~46.67 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
By now, you pretty much should have obtained all Anti-starred Alien Treasures. If you haven't, the General GreGories would be buffed to tremendous levels.

In this stage, the Elephantidae Papaou will attack your frontline while the highly buffed General GreGories will push forward. Bring units with high damage to aliens, like [[Bora (Uber Rare Cat)|Bazibastra]] or [[Miter Saw Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Neo Saw Cat]], and lure the first GreGories alongside the Crustaceous Scissorex to take them out without worrying about Elephantidae Papaou. You also should bring high range damagers to take out the Elephantidae Papaou once he reaches your frontline, because the GreGories don't stop, and will protect Papaou the whole time.

